{"id":"d09d6567cd8efb10","group":"14","path":"14/14-thm-covering-sieve-closure.md","title":"Theorem — Covering Sieves are Upward Closed and Closed under Intersection","display":"Theorem — Covering Sieves are Upward Closed and Closed under Intersection","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-thm-covering-sieve-closure","aliases":["14-thm-covering-sieve-closure"],"display":"Theorem — Covering Sieves are Upward Closed and Closed under Intersection","depends_on":["[[14-df-grothendieck-topology]]","[[14-df-sieve]]","[[14-df-sieve-pullback]]"],"source_status":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-thm-covering-sieve-closure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-thm-covering-sieve-closure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Theorem — Covering Sieves are Upward Closed and Closed under Intersection"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3fcbbf29a7947555\" href=\"?note=3fcbbf29a7947555\" title=\"14-df-grothendieck-topology\">14-df-grothendieck-topology</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"74b7dc7dd3d7dcb5\" href=\"?note=74b7dc7dd3d7dcb5\" title=\"14-df-sieve\">14-df-sieve</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"55b5b594c94a4b33\" href=\"?note=55b5b594c94a4b33\" title=\"14-df-sieve-pullback\">14-df-sieve-pullback</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_status","html":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\mathcal C,J)\">\\((\\mathcal C,J)\\)</span> 是小站点，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\">\\(C\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S,T,R\">\\(S,T,R\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 上的筛。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{gathered}\nS\\in J(C)\\land S\\subseteq R\\land\\mathrm{IsSieve}_{\\mathcal C}(R,C)\\to R\\in J(C),\\\\\nS,T\\in J(C)\\to S\\cap T\\in J(C).\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{gathered}\nS\\in J(C)\\land S\\subseteq R\\land\\mathrm{IsSieve}_{\\mathcal C}(R,C)\\to R\\in J(C),\\\\\nS,T\\in J(C)\\to S\\cap T\\in J(C).\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书定位：III.2 的覆盖公理及其推论，印刷页 109–111；DjVu 第 60–61 图页。以下给出由这些公理推出的论证。第一式：对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in S\">\\(f\\in S\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f^*R\">\\(f^*R\\)</span> 含所有可射入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{dom}(f)\">\\(\\mathrm{dom}(f)\\)</span> 的箭头，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\subseteq R\">\\(S\\subseteq R\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> 为筛，所以逆像为极大筛；局部性推出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> 覆盖。第二式：对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in S\">\\(f\\in S\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f^*(S\\cap T)=f^*T\">\\(f^*(S\\cap T)=f^*T\\)</span>，由稳定性它覆盖，再由局部性得到交覆盖。这是 plus 等价关系传递性所需的真实上游。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-grothendieck-topology","status":"resolved","id":"3fcbbf29a7947555","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-grothendieck-topology]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-sieve","status":"resolved","id":"74b7dc7dd3d7dcb5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-sieve]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-sieve-pullback","status":"resolved","id":"55b5b594c94a4b33","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-sieve-pullback]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"(\\mathcal C,J)","display":false},{"tex":"C\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)","display":false},{"tex":"S,T,R","display":false},{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{gathered}\nS\\in J(C)\\land S\\subseteq R\\land\\mathrm{IsSieve}_{\\mathcal C}(R,C)\\to R\\in J(C),\\\\\nS,T\\in J(C)\\to S\\cap T\\in J(C).\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"f\\in S","display":false},{"tex":"f^*R","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{dom}(f)","display":false},{"tex":"S\\subseteq R","display":false},{"tex":"R","display":false},{"tex":"R","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in S","display":false},{"tex":"f^*(S\\cap T)=f^*T","display":false}],"bytes":1312,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-112","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-covering-sieve-closure|Theorem — Covering Sieves are Upward Closed and Closed under Intersection]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-207","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-covering-sieve-closure]]"},{"id":"3fcbbf29a7947555","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"三条公理分别是极大筛覆盖、覆盖对逆像稳定、覆盖的局部性。上闭性与有限交封闭性可推出，见 [[14-thm-covering-sieve-closure]]；不能另把“筛包含恒等箭头”加入覆盖定义，否则退化成极大筛。"},{"id":"365bea28fb7d89a0","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"a4004ce206bd12ec","anchor":"ref-46","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-covering-sieve-closure]]"},{"id":"ffda0c0482667c45","anchor":"ref-144","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-covering-sieve-closure]]"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-113","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-covering-sieve-closure|Theorem — Covering Sieves are Upward Closed and Closed under Intersection]]"},{"id":"68f3350ee8219486","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"3d83677380a58c7f","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["3fcbbf29a7947555","74b7dc7dd3d7dcb5","55b5b594c94a4b33"]}